# Build context is the parent folder of both repositories (see Dockerfile), so the patterns
# carry the repository folder. Keeps secrets, local state and caches out of the image.
# Later rules win: first allow only the two repositories, then exclude inside them.
*
!fg-actuarial-science-discord-bot
!swiss-actuarial-job-scraper

**/.git
**/.github
**/.env
**/.envrc
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.log
fg-actuarial-science-discord-bot/logs
swiss-actuarial-job-scraper/data
swiss-actuarial-job-scraper/reports
swiss-actuarial-job-scraper/logs
swiss-actuarial-job-scraper/exports
